<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-chenshu" book-id="b-chenshu-028" chapter-id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons" source-id="s-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons-ws2581394">
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">後主二十二男：<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p001:m0007" ref="3jv_fyp_o96">張貴妃</persName>生皇太子<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p001:m0014" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AA">深</persName>、會稽王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p001:m0019" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AC">莊</persName></p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p002:m0000" ref="zab_l1p_azm">龔貴嬪</persName>生南海王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p002:m0007" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AD">虔</persName>、錢塘王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p002:m0012" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AE">恬</persName></p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">皇太子<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p003:m0003" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AA">深</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p003:m0005" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AA">承源</persName>，後主第四子也。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p004" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">南海王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p004:m0003" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AD">虔</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p004:m0005" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AD">承恪</persName>，後主第五子也。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p005" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">會稽王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p005:m0003" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AC">莊</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p005:m0005" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AC">承肅</persName>，後主第八子也。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p006" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">錢塘王<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p006:m0003" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AE">恬</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-028-zhanglihua-sons:p006:m0005" ref="icd_mkz_d9n_AE">承惔</persName>，後主第十一子也。</p>
</text>
